WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.039
Welcome to Orbit. Yesterday was different. Our focus is was / were.

2
00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:14.397
Use was with I, he, she and it. Use were with you, we and they to talk about the past.

3
00:00:14.397 --> 00:00:17.311
Ali was in a village last weekend.

4
00:00:17.311 --> 00:00:19.600
His parents were with him.

5
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.079
The weather was sunny yesterday.

6
00:00:22.079 --> 00:00:31.477
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
